":"Keiko Sasahara (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p5A7efRBlhmhtdyfbpmjJgeUkhq.jpg"},{"id":90137,"name":"Nobuyuki Hiyama","role":"Harunobu Madarame (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxAzBPZGSzec9rtulmORY84ijzT.jpg"},{"id":90567,"name":"Tomokazu Seki","role":"Soichiro Tanaka (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jGQC9KkfNMh2wBgizw81GLX2KN2.jpg"},{"id":550663,"name":"Koji Ishii","role":"Haraguchi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ao882dlS1ERrar6iq0qedBVBAhH.jpg"},{"id":115303,"name":"Sanae Kobayashi","role":"Kitagawa (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yMNnNg1ouQtSaieUYk9KNizuLSV.jpg"},{"id":1252591,"name":"Eiji Yanagisawa","role":"Takayanagi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ecNS19vYj2pxLXYvasXegN6H6TF.jpg"},{"id":9716,"name":"Kenji Nomura","role":"Mitsunori Kugayama (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmTziYxlPje4PiKhPgqMEHu9Axd.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Genshiken","overview":"Genshiken è una commedia che vede come protagonisti dei ragazzi appassionati di manga e anime e che narra le loro divertenti giornate come otaku."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Genshiken","overview":"Sasahara Kanji is a college freshman who decides to join a student society to share his hidden thoughts on manga, anime and gaming. As he participates in club activities such as visiting dojin shops and anime festivals he opens his mind and resolves that he will make his way into the otaku world."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"俺に足りないのは覚悟だ…… 平凡な大学生の日常に流れるオタクライフと その成長を描いた、アキバ系青春ストーリー！ 「覚悟」を決めた笹原の明日はどっちだ!?笹原完士は大学入学を機にそれまで秘めていた「漫画・アニメ・ゲーム」への思いを分かち合えるサークルへ入ることを決意した新入生。見学で訪れた「現代視覚文化研究会」＝「現視研（げんしけん）」の2年生・斑目の策略により根拠のないプライドを崩された笹原だったが、未だ自分がオタクであることを認められないでいた。しかし、同人ショップや即売会など、そのモデル並のルックスに反比例したオタク・高坂、そして斑目たち「現視研」のメンバーと行動をともにしていくなかで、ココロを解放していった笹原はこの道に進む覚悟！を決めていく。高坂にベタ惚れな（非オタク）春日部咲やコスプレイヤー・大野など様々な人間も加わって、今日も「現視研」を舞台にした笹原のオタクライフはゆるりと流れるのであった。","tagline":"俺に足りないのは覚悟だ… 平凡な大学生の日常に流れるオタクライフと その成長を描いた、アキバ系青春ストーリー！"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eLQTjB7Px5L0HnLzH4K490DfS36.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eLQTjB7Px5L0HnLzH4K490DfS36.png","language":"en","width":793,"height":241},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vABOy69qm9TGfnXkbW7x8Zf1dej.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vABOy69qm9TGfnXkbW7x8Zf1dej.png","language":"ja","width":556,"height":221}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/erC2U9IB0eIJpecKE6QxuK9Rkab.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/erC2U9IB0eIJpecKE6QxuK9Rkab.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/blEL6Nsb50sazJs65cYm0WGMBak.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/blEL6Nsb50sazJs65cYm0WGMBak.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yLcLMV2c0ndmlvfcyyLzaE4dRjb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yLcLMV2c0ndmlvfcyyLzaE4dRjb.jpg","language":"en","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wWkEUlKc3HBANSRdQgVe4vcMrkx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wWkEUlKc3HBANSRdQgVe4vcMrkx.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/beP36wpD4sWYKZ70mzQV2cJLXq9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/beP36wpD4sWYKZ70mzQV2cJLXq9.jpg","language":"en","width":680,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A08BbxuWLWzJ98NZTh1xY6jJ0tP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A08BbxuWLWzJ98NZTh1xY6jJ0tP.jpg","language":"ja","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t5iGGDflgcukDpx2pC7sIY1kPAG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://ima